      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix: clear timeout timer in Nostr profile relay publish loop",
        "body": "Related: #98463\n\n## What Problem This Solves\n\nPer-relay `setTimeout` timeout is never cleared when relay publish succeeds.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nWrap `Promise.race` in `try/finally` that captures and clears the timer handle.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNo user-visible change. Prevents timer leak when publishing Nostr profiles.\n\n## Evidence\n\n**Runtime terminal proof:**\n\n![screenshot](https://github.com/zhangLei99586/openclaw/blob/proof-screenshots/pr-98135-proof.png?raw=true)\n\n- 31/31 tests passed (`nostr-profile.test.ts`)",
